  "bodyHash": "9245de9aee72c0d6",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lUuE4jX.png\" alt=\"礦物生長橫幅\" width=\"1110\" height=\"351\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>「礦物生長」</strong>允許晶簇在礦石上生長！隨後可採集這些晶簇以獲取資源。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJlpisR.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>預設設定</strong></h4>\n<h5>預設情況下，晶簇可在任何原版礦石以及古代遺骸上生長。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cOOwZGx.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>自訂配方</strong></h4>\n<h5>「礦物生長」完全支援自訂，透過自訂配方即可讓晶簇在特定方塊上生長。新增配方或調整預設配方均可透過數據包（datapack）完成。</h5>\n<h5>要新增配方，只需在您的數據包中建立一個新的配方檔案，並將類型設為 `oregrowth:ore_growth`。以下是讓晶簇在南瓜上生長的礦物生長配方屬性範例：</h5>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:20px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h6 style=\"background-color:rgba(67,73,86,0.8);border:5px solid rgba(67,73,86,0.8)\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">{<br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"type\": \"oregrowth:ore_growth\",</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"base\": [</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"minecraft:pumpkin\"</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;], <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 晶簇生長的基礎方塊</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"stages\": 4, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 晶簇的生長階段數，最多 4 個階段</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"spawn_chance\": 0.2, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 基礎方塊獲得隨機刻時，晶簇生成的機率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"growth_chance\": 0.3, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 晶簇獲得隨機刻時，生長的機率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"drops\": [</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"stage\": 4, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 此掉落物的生長階段，亦可指定 'min_stage' 與 'max_stage'</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"chance\": 0.9, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 選填，獲得此掉落物的機率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"item\": {</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"id\": \"minecraft:pumpkin_pie\",</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"count\": 2</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;}</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"min_stage\": 1, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 此掉落物的最低階段</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"max_stage\": 3, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 此掉落物的最高階段</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"chance\": 0.3, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 選填，獲得此掉落物的機率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"loot_table\": \"minecraft:blocks/short_grass\" <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 用於獲取物品的戰利品表</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;]</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">}</span></h6>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:20px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Sp2j1Yl.png\" alt=\"南瓜上生長的晶簇\" width=\"335\" height=\"415\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>為方便起見，設定檔提供選項可停用所有預設配方、縮放所有礦物生長配方的生成機率，以及縮放所有礦物生長配方的生長機率。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bDXpr0y.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>配方檢視器整合</strong></h4>\n<h5>所有礦物生長配方皆可在配方檢視模組中查看。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eURhlC2.gif\" alt=\"JEI 中的礦物生長配方範例\" width=\"404\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJlpisR.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Jade 與 The One Probe 整合</strong></h4>\n<h5>Jade 與 The One Probe 均會顯示晶簇的生長進度。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/6M4iXVJ.png\" alt=\"Jade 提示框顯示晶簇生長進度\" width=\"400\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cOOwZGx.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>模組相容性</strong></h4>\n<h5>「礦物生長」已針對以下模組的礦石提供相容性：</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/334/259/637467878829043643.png\" alt=\"Additional Blocks: Stone Edition\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Additional Blocks: Stone Edition</strong></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/471/574/637760293478357857.png\" alt=\"BetterNether\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>BetterNether</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/471/575/637760294980874674.png\" alt=\"BetterEnd\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>BetterEnd</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/300/480/637357968773910837.png\" alt=\"Bigger Reactors\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Bigger Reactors</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/393/435/637588742363737916.png\" alt=\"Create\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Create</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/832/437/638223405540661871.png\" alt=\"Deep Aether\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Deep Aether</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/619/371/638006658643873232.png\" alt=\"Enderscape\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Enderscape</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/310/376/637398551210975973.png\" alt=\"Extreme Reactors\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Extreme Reactors</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/285/254/637300336290714863.png\" alt=\"Gems &amp; Jewels\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Gems &amp; Jewels</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/292/719/637326741883981172.png\" alt=\"Industrial Revolution\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Industrial Revolution</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/492/672/637801316302309362.png\" alt=\"Mekanism\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Mekanism</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/169/286/636714350437863347.png\" alt=\"Mystical Agriculture\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Mystical Agriculture</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/803/422/638168935805052874.png\" alt=\"Mythic Metals\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Mythic Metals</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/371/724/637541818592011791.png\" alt=\"Pigsteel\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Pigsteel</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/249/665/637174779164720984.png\" alt=\"Powah\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Powah</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/22/510/635743559787349935.png\" alt=\"RFTools\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>RFTools</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/868/743/638283333991324018.png\" alt=\"Spelunkery\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Spelunkery</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" alt=\"The Aether\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>The Aether</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/416/888/637640074076654754.png\" alt=\"Thermal Foundation\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Thermal Foundation</strong></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bDXpr0y.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>常見問題</strong></h4>\n<h5><strong>這個模組不是過於強力嗎？</strong></h5>\n<h5>是的，但可能沒有您想像中那麼誇張，因為晶簇生長需要相當長的時間。例如，鑽石礦石的晶簇可能需要 30 分鐘到 1 小時才能完全生長。</h5>\n<h5><strong>我可以將您的模組放入我的整合包中嗎？</strong></h5>\n<h5>可以，歡迎將本模組用於您的整合包中。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJlpisR.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4>\n<h5>想關注未來內容、即將推出的模組及進行討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"加入 Discord 按鈕\" width=\"373\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cOOwZGx.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>",
